    <body>
      <div xml:id="gom-sir21">
        <head xml:id="gom-sir21-Hd1e98">Caput 21</head>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir21-Dd1e100">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir21-Hd1e102">Versus 1</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir21-d1e104">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir21-Qd1e106" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir21_1@1-2">Fili, peccasti,</quote>
            etc.
            <ref xml:id="gom-sir21-Rd1e109"><name xml:id="gom-sir21-Nd1e110" ref="#RabanusMaurus">RAB.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir21-Qd1e113">Consilium dat, cum peccamus: <quote xml:id="gom-sir21-Qd1e115" source="http://scta.info/resource/qoh7_21@1-13">Non est enim qui faciat bonum, et non peccet</quote>, ne iterum peccemus; sed de praeteritis poenitentiam agamus, deprecantes ut nobis dimittantur.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir21-Dd1e121">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir21-Hd1e123">Versus 2</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir21-d1e125">
            <pb ed="#P" n="1205C"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir21-Qd1e129" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir21_2@4-4">Colubri.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-sir21-Rd1e132"><name xml:id="gom-sir21-Nd1e133" ref="#RabanusMaurus">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir21-Qd1e136">Diaboli qui semper colit umbras peccati, et regnat in filiis tenebrarum.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir21-Dd1e140">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir21-Hd1e142">Versus 3</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir21-d1e144">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir21-Qd1e146" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir21_3@1-2">Dentes leonis,</quote>
            etc. <quote xml:id="gom-sir21-Qd1e149" source="http://scta.info/resource/Ipetr5_8@5-14">Adversarius noster diabolus, tanquam leo rugiens, circuit quaerens quem devoret</quote>.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir21-Dd1e154">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir21-Hd1e156">Versus 5</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir21-d1e158">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir21-Qd1e160" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir21_5@2-3">Objurgatio et injuriae,</quote>
            etc.
            <ref xml:id="gom-sir21-Rd1e163"><name xml:id="gom-sir21-Nd1e164" ref="#RabanusMaurus">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir21-Qd1e167"><seg type="qs">Concordia minimae res crescunt</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">quia veritatem fidei et unitatem pacis abominatur.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir21-Dd1e177">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir21-Hd1e179">Versus 6</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir21-d1e181">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir21-Qd1e183" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir21_6@1-2">Deprecatio pauperis,</quote>
            etc. Quia judicabit Deus impios, qui affligunt sanctos.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir21-Dd1e188">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir21-Hd1e190">Versus 7</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir21-d1e192">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir21-Qd1e194" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir21_7@3-3">Correptionem.</quote>
            Id est, judicium sui peccati, quia mentem suam induravit, ne obediret veritati.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir21-Dd1e199">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir21-Hd1e201">Versus 8</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir21-d1e203">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir21-Qd1e205" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir21_8@1-3">Notus a longe.</quote>
            Manifestatur praesumptio haeretica in lingua temeraria, quae loquitur adversus <pb ed="#P" n="1205D"/> Deum iniquitatem.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir21-Dd1e212">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir21-Hd1e214">Versus 9</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir21-d1e216">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir21-Qd1e218" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir21_9@1-3">Qui aedificat domum,</quote>
            etc. Haereticum significat, qui Scripturae testimonia a pravo sensu aliena, ad confirmationem sui erroris congregat. Sed vindicta ultionis justae dissolvetur duritia nefandae actionis; vel tropologice: Avarum raptorem, qui ex alienis rebus auget divitias, et vacuus omnibus bonis in die judicii pro iniquitate sua punietur.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir21-Dd1e223">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir21-Hd1e225">Versus 11</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir21-d1e227">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir21-Qd1e229" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir21_11@1-2">Via peccantium.</quote>
            Ideo velox malorum interitus, quia via, id est vita illorum plena est doloribus: et duris peccatorum operibus.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir21-Dd1e234">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir21-Hd1e236">Versus 14</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir21-d1e238">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir21-Qd1e240" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir21_14@1-2">Non erudietur,</quote>
            etc.
            <ref xml:id="gom-sir21-Rd1e243"><name xml:id="gom-sir21-Nd1e244" ref="#RabanusMaurus">RAB.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir21-Qd1e247"><seg type="qs">His sententiis confundit</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">et ipse immiscuit se infinitis quaestionibus.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir21-Dd1e257">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir21-Hd1e259">Versus 18</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir21-d1e261">
            <pb ed="#P" n="1206A"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir21-Qd1e265" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir21_18@14-15">Displicet illi,</quote>
            etc. Unde: <quote xml:id="gom-sir21-Qd1e268" source="http://scta.info/resource/lc16_8@10-19">Filii hujus saeculi prudentiores filiis lucis in generatione sua sunt</quote>.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir21-Dd1e273">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir21-Hd1e275">Versus 22</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir21-d1e277">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir21-Qd1e279" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir21_22@1-3">Compedes in pedibus,</quote>
            etc.
            <ref xml:id="gom-sir21-Rd1e282"><name xml:id="gom-sir21-Nd1e283" ref="#RabanusMaurus">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir21-Qd1e286">Quia gressibus eorum, quibus incedunt, ruina iniquitatis contradicit, actiones eorum damnando reprehendit.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir21-Dd1e290">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir21-Hd1e292">Versus 23</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir21-d1e294">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir21-Qd1e296" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir21_23@1-3">Fatuus in risu,</quote>
            etc. Coetus haereticorum plausibili operatione per rhetoricam artem docendo quaerit auditorum favorem. Sancti vero doctores jucunditatem locutione sic intermiscent praedicationi, ut non recedant a tramite veritatis.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir21-Dd1e301">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir21-Hd1e303">Versus 25</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir21-d1e305">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir21-Qd1e307" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir21_25@1-2">Pes fatui,</quote>
            etc. Quia haeretici auctorum suorum sectam in domicilio scriptorum suorum latitantem student imitari.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir21-Dd1e312">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir21-Hd1e314">Versus 26</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir21-d1e316">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir21-Qd1e318" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir21_26@1-3">Stultus a fenestra.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-sir21-Rd1e321"><name xml:id="gom-sir21-Nd1e322" ref="#RabanusMaurus">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir21-Qd1e325">Notat haereticorum <pb ed="#P" n="1206B"/> calliditatem, et catholicorum simplicitatem.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir21-Dd1e332">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir21-Hd1e334">Versus 30</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir21-d1e336">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir21-Qd1e338" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir21_30@1-2">Dum maledicit.</quote>
            Non quia maledictum dicit diabolum, sed quia quem maledictum novit, non cessat imitari. Dum enim mavult diabolum imitari, quam Christum, jure damnatur.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </body>
